{
  "metadata": {
    "script_name": "multicast_pim_sm.py",
    "description": "Topology with 4 routers (l1, f1, r2, c1, c2) and 8 interfaces (i1, i2, i3, i4, i5, i6, i7, i8). Used to test multicast PIM-SM.",
